sequenceDiagram
    actor Founder
    participant Edge as Pi / OpenVoiceOS
    participant Conv as Voice Orchestrator
    participant Insight as Insight Decision Service
    participant State as Business State Service
    participant MCP as Seleric MCP
    participant TTS as TTS Adapter

    Founder->>Edge: "Hey Seleric, how are we doing?"
    Edge->>Edge: Local wake word + VAD
    Edge->>Conv: audio/transcript + device/session context
    Conv->>Conv: Resolve bounded intent
    Conv->>Insight: get_company_health(brand, as_of)
    Insight->>State: get_latest_health_snapshot()
    alt Snapshot valid
        State-->>Insight: health + evidence + freshness
    else Snapshot missing/stale within bounded policy
        State->>MCP: certified metric query
        MCP-->>State: values + query_id + catalogue version + freshness
        State->>State: derive state and persist snapshot
        State-->>Insight: health + evidence + freshness
    end
    Insight-->>Conv: typed executive response
    Conv->>TTS: rendered text
    TTS-->>Edge: audio stream/file
    Edge-->>Founder: spoken answer
